# Premium Presentations

Read `skills/premium-presentations/SKILL.md` in full before building a deck (schema: `references/deck_spec_schema.md`).

Quick reference:
- Setup once: `bash skills/premium-design-kit/scripts/setup.sh`. Run scripts with `bash skills/premium-design-kit/scripts/run.sh <script>`.
- Ask style once if not given: `bash skills/premium-design-kit/scripts/run.sh skills/premium-design-kit/scripts/kit.py themes --html gallery.html`; brand only when asked.
- Build: `bash skills/premium-design-kit/scripts/run.sh skills/premium-presentations/scripts/build_deck.py deck.json out/deck.pptx` + `render_preview.py deck.json out/deck.html`.
- QA (mandatory): `validate_deck.py out/deck.pptx`, then `kit.py preview out/deck.pptx` and LOOK at the contact sheet.
- Arabic text → whole deck RTL automatically. Photos: `{"photo": "english query"}` → look at the contact sheet, pin with `{"stock": id}`.
- Real data only; gaps as [NEEDS: …]. Mix slide types; never 3 bullet slides in a row.
